recommend check-in (Keaton) -- %291 fired a second time today and was caught at the door this time, which is the remediation working and not a fix; one tree per star or a lock in bridge_to_zig is still your word, and it is the only thing standing between two capable sessions and duplicated laps. The branch sound/tally-bud-witness is signed and rebased onto a5c047cefe, merging clean, held only because main is checked out in the pier with a live peer -- it wants one fast-forward from a single-handed bench. Ungated and ready meanwhile: three more Tally modules (seed cheapest, stack most fundamental), and a re-read of exec_bit and geode_libraries in a still tree.
